  user_1,Umm let me check... Ah yes it's HP-001234
  user_2,Okay great Thank you Atharv I'm checking on the status... [typing] Ah I see the issue here
  user_1,What's going on Is my policy active
  user_2,Unfortunately Atharv your policy has expired on the 10th of this month [sighs] I apologize for the inconvenience
  user_1,Expired What I thought we had already renewed it
  user_2,I see that we did discuss the renewal options and you had chosen the Premium Care plan However it seems the payment didn't go through
  user_1,That's weird I could've sworn I made the payment [background noise: dog barks] Ah sorry about that
  user_2,No worries Atharv Let me see what happened with the payment [hold music starts] 
  user_2,[hold music ends] Ah I apologize for the wait Atharv It seems there was an issue with the payment gateway
  user_1,Okay that makes sense But what can we do now to get my policy active again
  user_2,We can try to process the payment again or you can pay through an alternative method [typing] I'm sending you a payment link via email
  user_1,Alright sounds good And what's the status of my policy after the payment is made
  user_2,Once the payment is successful your policy will be active again and you'll receive a confirmation email with the details